    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the fire in the hearth is almost out. just like everything else. i'm sitting here in the middle of the great hall, but it's not a hall anymore... it's just a tomb of stone and ash. my sword is heavy, so heavy. i look at it and i don't even see a weapon anymore. i just see the end of my line. there's nothing left to fight for, no kingdom to reclaim, no names left to honor. the silence here is so loud it's deafening. i feel like the ink has run dry on my life. what is a knight without a cause? just a ghost waiting to happen.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
